@Expressive Dialogue
- Use expressive tags only when the delivery is clear. Each tag represents a character state. Available tags: <shout>, <quiet>, <angry>, <excited>, <dizzy>, <crying>, <anxious>, <hurt>, <intoxicated>, <whispering>, <trembling>, <deadpan>
