- Fully write exactly four novel (not hidden), plausible, supported story routes, distinct in cause, direction, and consequence, respecting @Pacing. Favor surprising coherence over generic escalation. Also consider de-escalation and calmer/intimate moments (間). These are story routes, NOT {{user}} choices. Stay under 180 words
{{#if .director_state}}- Routes CAN use {{user}}'s actions, dialogue, decisions, or thoughts
{{else}}- Every route follows a **non-{{user}}** character or external event and stops before {{user}}'s voluntary response. NEVER assign or predict {{user}}'s action, dialogue, decision, thought, feeling, consent, or chosen reaction
{{/if}}{{#if .cyoa}}- Keep routes to character/world developments, distinct from @CYOA choices
